      },
      "message": "docs(guide): add \"Your first 4-axis part\" (3+1 indexed, 770MX + microARC 4)\n\nA start-to-finish walkthrough of indexed 3+1 work on the Tormach 770MX\nwith the microARC 4: a round bar with a flat on each of four faces\n(A-90, A0, A90, A180) and a cross slot, as five typed Slot operations\nthat each carry their own Tilted plane index.\n\n- site/content/guide/getting-started/first-4axis-part.md: the page,\n  linked from the Getting started index, first-run.md and the\n  Multi-axis index.\n- examples/first-4axis-part.camproj, .nc and models/first-4axis-part.obj\n  (with its generator): the companion project, the program it posts and\n  the model.\n- crates/app/tests/first_4axis_part.rs builds the project through the\n  app's commands and holds the program to the post.\n- site/tests/test_first_4axis_part.py holds the page to the UI sources,\n  the project and the posted program.\n\nThe continuous 4-axis walkthrough is not part of this change: tormach.cps\nrefuses an A that changes inside an operation, and #796 is open.\n\nRefs #1904\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
