      "message": "fix(multiaxis): refuse out-of-range 3+2 tilt by name and keep A0 B180 plane X on machine X\n\n- Add Tilt::refusal and wire it into OpParams::named_refusal and\n  feedback::apply_hint so an out-of-range Tool axis A or B names the\n  field, states the canonical -90..90 / -180..180 bounds, and gives the\n  A 0 B 180 pose for the face opposite the top.\n- Zero axis components below 1e-12 in TiltedFrame::new before picking the\n  tie-breaking seed axis so sin(180 deg) float dust no longer swaps X\n  and Y on the A 0 B 180 face.\n- Stacked on #2135: update first-4axis-part.md, first_4axis_part.rs, and\n  examples/first-4axis-part.camproj so Flat A180 uses the same along-X\n  ends as the other three flats.\n- Pin with unit, app/MCP, and UI Apply-hint tests, and record the\n  decision in docs/decisions/2133-tilt-a180-refusal-basis.md.\n\nFixes #2133",
